OL,3,GNEWSARemoval of athletics track paused
OL,4,Aafter backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to remove an indoor athletics
OL,7,Ftrack in north-west London have been
OL,8,Fpaused amid concerns hundreds of young
OL,9,Fathletes could lose a year-round
OL,10,Ftraining facility.
OL,12,FThe track at Willesden Sports Centre is
OL,13,Fdue to close as part of a #1.4m
OL,14,Fredevelopment, which Brent Council said
OL,15,Fwould improve facilities.
OL,17,FOpposition councillors said the
OL,18,Fdecision, originally approved in June,
OL,19,Fwas not included in cabinet papers or
OL,20,Fcommunicated to athletics groups
OL,21,Fbeforehand.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
