OL,3,GNEWSARemoval of athletics track paused
OL,4,Aafter backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA further consultation will take place
OL,7,Fbefore a decision on 25 November, a
OL,8,Fmove welcomed by Patrik Ewe, chief
OL,9,Fexecutive of youth charity Track
OL,10,FAcademy, who said it was "a shame" it
OL,11,Fhad taken "immense public and community
OL,12,Fpressure" to secure one.
